OL,3,GNEWSABBC's Nicky Campbell tells court
OL,4,Ateacher who attacked him 'completely
OL,5,Alost it'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBroadcaster Nicky Campbell has told a
OL,8,Fcourt a maths teacher "completely lost
OL,9,Fit" and violently attacked him in the
OL,10,Fcourtyard of Edinburgh Academy when he
OL,11,Fwas a pupil there in the 1970s.
OL,13,FThe 65-year-old said he was around 15
OL,14,Fwhen he was initially "yanked from
OL,15,Fbehind" by Colin Turner beside a school
OL,16,Fnoticeboard when he was running late
OL,17,Ffor class.
OL,19,FCampbell said he was then "rag dolled"
OL,20,Fby the teacher and described being
OL,21,Fshaken, slapped and dragged across the
OL,22,Fplayground.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
